# Build context for sd-cli only.
#
# The Dockerfile compiles stable-diffusion.cpp from a pinned git clone and copies
# nothing from this directory — every build sent the whole models/ tree (31 GB)
# to BuildKit for nothing, which was most of a 700-second build. Models are
# bind-mounted at run time (see docker-compose.gpu.yml) and never belong in the
# context.
models/
outputs/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.gguf
*.safetensors
*.onnx
*.log
